\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces CODA v2 dynamics on COMPAS (XGBoost, seed 42). The threshold trajectories in (a) show clean convergence---the unprivileged group threshold rises while the privileged group threshold decreases, leading to near-perfect DPR in (c). The dual variable $\lambda $ in (b) remains mostly near zero, indicating CODA achieves fairness with minimal corrective pressure.}}{9}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dynamics_compas}{{2}{9}{CODA v2 dynamics on COMPAS (XGBoost, seed 42). The threshold trajectories in (a) show clean convergence---the unprivileged group threshold rises while the privileged group threshold decreases, leading to near-perfect DPR in (c). The dual variable $\lambda $ in (b) remains mostly near zero, indicating CODA achieves fairness with minimal corrective pressure}{figure.caption.17}{}}
